'''Nidhögg the Primal''' is the upgraded form of [[Nidhögg]] using [[Jade]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade, they gain 10 [[Poison|poison damage]] and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply [[Immobilized]].

* The primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit. No damage penalty against multiple targets.
* Its secondary attack deals 3x damage with a slightly longer reach.

An upgraded Nidhögg will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Nidhögg the Primal.

